<p><a href=3D"https://m3.material.io/foundations/design-tokens/overview">De=
sign tokens</a> are
the building blocks of all UI elements. Here they are
<a href=3D"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/--*">CSS custom=
 properties</a>
that you can override to style components. Version 3.0 provides the system
tokens for color, typography, shape, elevation, space, and motion.</p>
