<section class=3D"gb-all-page" id=3D"about-compliance" aria-labelledby=3D"a=
bout-compliance-title"><h1 id=3D"about-compliance-title">Spec compliance</h=
1><p class=3D"gb-lede">What the spec checks, ARIA and axe results, Baseline=
 use and size budgets say about md-gb-* components.</p><p class=3D"gb-all-s=
ource">Online: <a href=3D"https://material-web.dev/3.0/about/compliance/">h=
ttps://material-web.dev/3.0/about/compliance/</a></p><div class=3D"gb-conte=
nt"><div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"about-compliance--how-compliance-is-measured" tabindex=3D"-1">How=
 compliance is measured</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-compliance--how-compliance-is-measured">=
<span class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CHow compliance is measured=E2=80=
=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<p>The numbers on this page come from the repository itself and are regener=
ated
by <code>node scripts/m3/gen-compliance-page.mjs</code> (<code>--check</cod=
e> fails when this page
is stale). The M3 spec is downloaded with <code>npm run m3:update</code>, s=
plit into
<strong>units</strong> (a sentence, list item, table row or image descripti=
on, each with an
id), and <code>node scripts/m3/spec-checks.mjs --offline</code> records wha=
t happens to
each one in <code>.m3-specs/spec-checks/units.json</code>. Only unit counts=
 and ids are
used here, never spec text.</p>
<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"about-compliance--spec-units" tabindex=3D"-1">Spec units</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-compliance--spec-units"><span class=3D"o=
ffscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CSpec units=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=3D"=
true">#</span></a></div>
<p>A unit is <strong>buildable</strong> when the classifier scores it at 0.=
3 or more
(it describes something a component can do, not a caption or designer advic=
e).
<strong>Tested</strong> units are cited from a <code>*_test.ts</code> file =
under <code>labs/gb</code> or
<code>scripts/m3</code> (<code>spec: &lt;unit id&gt;</code>). <strong>Exclu=
ded</strong> units have a written reason in
<code>scripts/m3/exclusions/*.md</code> (<code>spec-exclude:</code>). <stro=
ng>Tracked</strong> units are known
