<p><code>node scripts/m3/audit-gb.mjs --gaps</code> compares every token de=
claration in the
<code>labs/gb</code> token files with the M3 token database. <strong>Match<=
/strong> means the value
equals the spec; <strong>derived</strong> means it is computed from a match=
ing token;
<strong>drift</strong> differs from the spec; <strong>no spec token</strong=
> has no counterpart in the
database; <strong>gaps</strong> are tokens the Compose reference uses that =
no gb
declaration implements.</p>
