<section class=3D"gb-all-page" id=3D"about-migration" aria-labelledby=3D"ab=
out-migration-title"><h1 id=3D"about-migration-title">Migration</h1><p clas=
s=3D"gb-lede">Version 3.0 renames most elements from md- to md-gb- and move=
s them to Material 3 Expressive.</p><p class=3D"gb-all-source">Online: <a h=
ref=3D"https://material-web.dev/3.0/about/migration/">https://material-web.=
dev/3.0/about/migration/</a></p><div class=3D"gb-content"><p>Version 3.0 re=
names most elements from <code>md-*</code> to <code>md-gb-*</code> and move=
