<p>Then import each <code>md-gb-*</code> element you use from
<code>@material/web/labs/gb/components/</code>.</p>
<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"about-migration--element-and-attribute-map" tabindex=3D"-1">Eleme=
nt and attribute map</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-migration--element-and-attribute-map"><s=
pan class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CElement and attribute map=E2=80=9D=
</span> <span aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<p>Element names change as listed below. Where the table says "dropped", th=
e 2.5.0
attribute has no 3.0 counterpart and you can remove it.</p>
<div class=3D"gb-table" tabindex=3D"0" role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Table =
6"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>2.5.0</th>
<th>3.0</th>
<th>Changes</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>md-filled-button</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-button</code></td>
<td><code>color=3D"filled"</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-elevated-button</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-button</code></td>
<td><code>color=3D"elevated"</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-filled-tonal-button</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-button</code></td>
<td><code>color=3D"tonal"</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-outlined-button</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-button</code></td>
<td><code>color=3D"outlined"</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-text-button</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-button</code></td>
<td><code>color=3D"text"</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-icon-button</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-icon-button</code></td>
<td><code>color=3D"standard"</code>; <code>toggle</code> and <code>flip-ico=
n-in-rtl</code> dropped</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-filled-icon-button</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-icon-button</code></td>
<td><code>color=3D"filled"</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-filled-tonal-icon-button</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-icon-button</code></td>
<td><code>color=3D"tonal"</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-outlined-icon-button</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-icon-button</code></td>
<td><code>color=3D"outlined"</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-fab</code>, <code>md-branded-fab</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-fab</code></td>
<td><code>variant</code> becomes <code>color</code> (<code>primary-containe=
r</code>, <code>secondary-container</code>, <code>tertiary-container</code>=
); <code>size=3D"large"</code> becomes <code>size=3D"lg"</code>; <code>labe=
l</code> becomes text content; <code>size</code>, <code>lowered</code> and =
<code>variant</code> dropped</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-checkbox</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-checkbox</code></td>
<td><code>touch-target</code> dropped</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-radio</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-radio</code></td>
<td><code>touch-target</code> dropped</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-switch</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-switch</code></td>
<td>none</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-slider</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-slider</code></td>
<td><code>aria-*</code> label and value text attributes renamed (see below)=
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-divider</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-divider</code></td>
<td><code>inset</code>, <code>inset-start</code> and <code>inset-end</code>=
 dropped</td>
</tr>
<tr>
