</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-menu</code>, <code>md-menu-item</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-menu</code>, <code>md-gb-menu-item</code></td>
<td><code>positioning</code>, <code>menu-corner</code> and <code>anchor-cor=
ner</code> dropped on <code>md-gb-menu</code>; the same slot changes as lis=
ts</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-linear-progress</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-progress</code></td>
