label</code> becomes text content</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-filter-chip</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-chip</code></td>
<td><code>type=3D"filter"</code>; same color rule</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-input-chip</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-chip</code></td>
<td><code>type=3D"input"</code> with <code>removable</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-suggestion-chip</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-chip</code></td>
<td><code>type=3D"suggestion"</code>; same color rule</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>md-icon</code></td>
<td><code>md-gb-icon</code></td>
<td>inside a button, icon button, FAB or tab, the <code>slot=3D"icon"</code=
> is removed and the icon goes in DOM order</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<p>If the icon is not an <code>md-icon</code> (for example an inline SVG), =
wrap it in
<code>md-gb-icon</code>.</p>
<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"about-migration--attributes-to-rename-by-hand" tabindex=3D"-1">At=
tributes to rename by hand</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-migration--attributes-to-rename-by-hand"=
><span class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CAttributes to rename by hand=E2=
=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<p>Converting the elements does not rename every attribute. Update these by=
 hand:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>md-gb-slider</code>: <code>aria-label-start</code> becomes <code>=
label-start</code>, <code>aria-label-end</code>
becomes <code>label-end</code>, <code>aria-valuetext-start</code> becomes <=
code>valuetext-start</code>, and
<code>aria-valuetext-end</code> becomes <code>valuetext-end</code>. The <co=
de>aria-</code> prefix is reserved
for ARIA attributes, so the 3.0 names do not use it. <code>value-label-star=
t</code> and
<code>value-label-end</code> keep their names.</li>
<li><code>md-gb-dialog</code>: <code>full-screen</code> applies only on com=
pact windows. Above that,
the dialog is a basic dialog with the same slots. Add <code>always-full-scr=
een</code> to
keep the full-screen layout at every window size. The 2.5.0 <code>md-dialog=
</code> has
no full-screen attribute, so this is new in 3.0.</li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"about-migration--recommendations-that-changed" tabindex=3D"-1">Re=
commendations that changed</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-migration--recommendations-that-changed"=
><span class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CRecommendations that changed=E2=
=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<p>The Expressive spec no longer recommends some 2.5.0 patterns. The compon=
ents
remain available, but for new work use the replacement below.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Segmented buttons</strong> are replaced by a connected button g=
roup:
<code>md-gb-button-group variant=3D"connected"</code>.</li>
<li><strong>Navigation drawer</strong> is replaced by an expanded navigatio=
n rail:
<code>md-gb-nav-rail</code> with <code>expanded</code>. Use <code>modal</co=
de> when it overlays content.</li>
<li><strong>Bottom app bar</strong> is replaced by a docked toolbar: <code>=
md-gb-toolbar docked</code>.</li>
<li><strong>Medium and large app bars</strong> are replaced by medium and l=
arge flexible app
bars: <code>md-gb-app-bar size=3D"md"</code> and <code>size=3D"lg"</code>.<=
/li>
<li><strong>Small FABs and surface-colored FABs</strong> are replaced by th=
e default FAB size
and the container colors (<code>primary-container</code>, <code>secondary-c=
ontainer</code>,
<code>tertiary-container</code>).</li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"about-migration--watch-out-for" tabindex=3D"-1">Watch out for</h2=
>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-migration--watch-out-for"><span class=3D=
"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CWatch out for=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidde=
n=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>Chips and FABs no longer take their text from a <code>label</code> attr=
ibute. Put the
text in the element instead, as the table shows.</li>
<li>An <code>md-gb-*</code> element that is not imported is not upgraded, s=
o it renders as
an unknown element.</li>
<li>Selectors, queries and tests that use the old <code>md-*</code> tag nam=
es need the new
names too.</li>
</ul>
</div></section>
<section class=3D"gb-all-page" id=3D"about-roadmap" aria-labelledby=3D"abou=
t-roadmap-title"><h1 id=3D"about-roadmap-title">Roadmap</h1><p class=3D"gb-=
lede">This roadmap describes current, future, and past goals for Material W=
eb Components.</p><p class=3D"gb-all-source">Online: <a href=3D"https://mat=
erial-web.dev/3.0/about/roadmap/">https://material-web.dev/3.0/about/roadma=
p/</a></p><div class=3D"gb-content"><div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"about-roadmap--current" tabindex=3D"-1">Current</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-roadmap--current"><span class=3D"offscre=
en">Link to =E2=80=9CCurrent=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=3D"true">#</=
span></a></div>
<p><strong>Version 3.0 (<code>labs/gb</code>) is the M3 Expressive implemen=
tation of MWC.</strong> It adds
Expressive components (such as the button group, split button, FAB menu,
carousel, loading indicator, and toolbar), dynamic color, the Expressive sh=
ape,
type, and motion systems, WAI-ARIA 1.3 conformance, and Web Platform Baseli=
ne
fallbacks. Version 2.5.0 remains in
<a href=3D"https://github.com/material-components/material-web/discussions/=
5642">maintenance mode</a>.</p>
<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"about-roadmap--future" tabindex=3D"-1">Future</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-roadmap--future"><span class=3D"offscree=
n">Link to =E2=80=9CFuture=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=3D"true">#</sp=
an></a></div>
<p><strong>Note: No future work is planned while MWC is in
<a href=3D"https://github.com/material-components/material-web/discussions/=
5642">maintenance mode</a>.</strong>
These roadmap items represent what used to be planned.</p>
<div class=3D"heading h3">
<h3 id=3D"about-roadmap--new-components" tabindex=3D"-1">New components</h3=
>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-roadmap--new-components"><span class=3D"=
offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CNew components=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidde=
n=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<p>Version 3.0 builds every component in the list 2.5.0 planned except thes=
e:</p>
<ul>
<li>Autocomplete</li>
<li>Banner</li>
<li>Data table</li>
</ul>
<p>The badge, bottom sheet, card, date and time pickers, navigation bar, dr=
awer
and rail, search, segmented button, snackbar, tooltip and top app bar are i=
n
<code>labs/gb</code>. The toolbar replaces the bottom app bar in M3 Express=
ive.</p>
<div class=3D"heading h3">
<h3 id=3D"about-roadmap--expand-material-design-tokens" tabindex=3D"-1">Exp=
and Material Design tokens</h3>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-roadmap--expand-material-design-tokens">=
<span class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CExpand Material Design tokens=E2=
=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<p>Version 3.0 has the shape and motion system tokens.</p>
<p>We also want to make it easier to use Material Design tokens, such as ap=
plying
Material typescale, shape, and color to your own components.</p>
<div class=3D"heading h3">
<h3 id=3D"about-roadmap--density-and-spacing-tokens" tabindex=3D"-1">Densit=
y and spacing tokens</h3>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-roadmap--density-and-spacing-tokens"><sp=
an class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CDensity and spacing tokens=E2=80=9D=
</span> <span aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<p>Density allows components to take up less vertical space for larger disp=
lays.
While we have some spacing tokens already, we need a comprehensive spacing
system to fully support density across components.</p>
<div class=3D"heading h3">
<h3 id=3D"about-roadmap--create-tsx-components" tabindex=3D"-1">Create TSX =
components</h3>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-roadmap--create-tsx-components"><span cl=
ass=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CCreate TSX components=E2=80=9D</span> <s=
pan aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<p><a href=3D"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/jsx.html">TSX</a=
> is a popular
language extension for frameworks like <a href=3D"https://reactjs.org/">Rea=
ct</a>. We want to
make it easier and more seamless to use Material Web Components in TSX.</p>
<div class=3D"heading h3">
<h3 id=3D"about-roadmap--explore-material-design-layouts" tabindex=3D"-1">E=
xplore Material Design layouts</h3>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-roadmap--explore-material-design-layouts=
"><span class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CExplore Material Design layout=
s=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<p>Components are only part of the story to build fully expressive Material=
 Design
applications. We want to explore ways to support building applications that
follow
<a href=3D"https://m3.material.io/foundations/layout/understanding-layout/o=
verview">Material's layout patterns</a>.</p>
<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"about-roadmap--past" tabindex=3D"-1">Past</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-roadmap--past"><span class=3D"offscreen"=
>Link to =E2=80=9CPast=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span><=
/a></div>
<div class=3D"heading h3">
<h3 id=3D"about-roadmap--follow-accessibility-best-practices" tabindex=3D"-=
1">Follow accessibility best practices</h3>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-roadmap--follow-accessibility-best-pract=
ices"><span class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CFollow accessibility best =
practices=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<p><em>Completed in Q1 2024</em></p>
<p>Everyone should be able to access and enjoy the web. We want our compone=
nts to
help others build accessible experiences. The following screen readers are =
fully
supported:</p>
<ul>
<li>VoiceOver</li>
<li>Talkback</li>
<li>ChromeVox</li>
<li>JAWS</li>
<li>NVDA</li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"heading h3">
<h3 id=3D"about-roadmap--cards-and-more" tabindex=3D"-1">Cards and more</h3=
>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-roadmap--cards-and-more"><span class=3D"=
offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CCards and more=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidde=
n=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<p><em>Completed in Q4 2023</em></p>
<ul>
<li>Components
<ul>
<li>=E2=9C=85
<a href=3D"https://github.com/material-components/material-web/tree/c9360e2=
310dee2896592649f8a8f9b03e2737bf2/labs/card">Card preview</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Features
<ul>
<li>=F0=9F=9F=A1 Prevent event default behavior
<ul>
<li><em>We fixed lots of bugs, but there's still ways we can improve.</em><=
/li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>=E2=9C=85
<a href=3D"https://github.com/material-components/material-web/blob/c9360e2=
310dee2896592649f8a8f9b03e2737bf2/docs/size.md">Size tracking</a></li>
<li>=E2=9C=85 <a href=3D"https://material-web.dev/">Docs and examples</a></=
li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"heading h3">
<h3 id=3D"about-roadmap--material-1.0" tabindex=3D"-1">Material 1.0</h3>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-roadmap--material-1.0"><span class=3D"of=
fscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CMaterial 1.0=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=3D=
"true">#</span></a></div>
<p><em>Completed in Q3 2023</em></p>
