<section class=3D"gb-all-page" id=3D"about-shadcn" aria-labelledby=3D"about=
-shadcn-title"><h1 id=3D"about-shadcn-title">Use with shadcn/ui</h1><p clas=
s=3D"gb-lede">Install the md-gb elements as React components with the shadc=
n CLI, themed by your shadcn variables.</p><p class=3D"gb-all-source">Onlin=
e: <a href=3D"https://material-web.dev/3.0/about/shadcn/">https://material-=
web.dev/3.0/about/shadcn/</a></p><div class=3D"gb-content"><div class=3D"he=
ading h2">
<h2 id=3D"about-shadcn--what-you-get" tabindex=3D"-1">What you get</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-shadcn--what-you-get"><span class=3D"off=
screen">Link to =E2=80=9CWhat you get=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=3D"=
true">#</span></a></div>
<p>This site is a <a href=3D"https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/registry">shadcn re=
gistry</a> at
<code>/3.0/r/</code>. <code>npx shadcn@latest add</code> copies a file into=
 your project, adds the
npm dependencies, and merges the theme:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>A React wrapper per component family</strong>, such as <code>md=
-button</code> or <code>md-menu</code>
(a menu with its group and item). The file is
<code>components/ui/md-&lt;name&gt;.tsx</code>. It registers the <code>md-g=
b-*</code> elements and wraps
each one with <a href=3D"https://lit.dev/docs/frameworks/react/"><code>@lit=
/react</code></a>:
typed props from the element class, and the events as <code>onChange</code>=
,
<code>onClose</code> and so on.</li>
<li><strong><code>md-theme</code></strong>, installed with every item: it l=
oads the M3 styles and maps
your shadcn variables to the M3 color and shape roles.</li>
<li><strong><code>md-theme-m3</code></strong>, optional: the reverse, the M=
3 baseline as shadcn
variables, so shadcn components match the md-gb elements.</li>
</ul>
<p>The registry lists every item in
<a href=3D"https://material-web.dev/3.0/r/registry.json"><code>registry.jso=
n</code></a>.</p>
<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"about-shadcn--add-a-component" tabindex=3D"-1">Add a component</h=
2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#about-shadcn--add-a-component"><span class=3D"=
offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CAdd a component=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidd=
en=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<p>The plain URL form needs no setup:</p>

