region" aria-label=3D"Code 36"><code class=3D"language-sh">npx shadcn@lates=
t <span class=3D"token function">add</span> https://material-web.dev/3.0/r/=
md-button.json</code></pre></div>
</lit-island>
<p>To use the short form, add the registry to <code>components.json</code> =
once. The keys of
<code>registries</code> start with <code>@</code>, and <code>{name}</code> =
is the item:</p>

