<td><code>--md-sys-color-primary-container</code></td>
<td><code>var(--accent)</code></td>
<td>shadcn has no primary container; accent is its tinted fill.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>--md-sys-color-on-primary-container</code></td>
<td><code>var(--accent-foreground)</code></td>
<td>Pairs with accent.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>--md-sys-color-secondary</code></td>
<td><code>var(--muted-foreground)</code></td>
<td>The mid-tone solid; text on it is --background.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>--md-sys-color-on-secondary</code></td>
