<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"foundations-interaction-states--watch-out-for" tabindex=3D"-1">Wa=
tch out for</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#foundations-interaction-states--watch-out-for"=
><span class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CWatch out for=E2=80=9D</span> <=
span aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>Do not restyle the state layer colors per screen. The opacities are par=
t of
the state, so keep them as they are.</li>
<li>Do not tell people to "hover to see" an action. Show it, or give it a
visible label.</li>
<li>Keep focus visible. The focus layer is not a replacement for the focus =
ring.</li>
</ul>
