lledby=3D"foundations-adaptive-layout-title"><h1 id=3D"foundations-adaptive=
-layout-title">Adaptive layout</h1><p class=3D"gb-lede">Pages and component=
s change with the window.</p><p class=3D"gb-all-source">Online: <a href=3D"=
https://material-web.dev/3.0/foundations/adaptive-layout/">https://material=
-web.dev/3.0/foundations/adaptive-layout/</a></p><div class=3D"gb-content">=
<p>labs/gb uses the M3 window size classes to pick the navigation, the numb=
er
of panes and how dialogs open.</p>
<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"foundations-adaptive-layout--window-size-classes" tabindex=3D"-1"=
>Window size classes</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#foundations-adaptive-layout--window-size-class=
es"><span class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CWindow size classes=E2=80=9D=
