<p><code>md-gb-app-scaffold</code> lays out the bars and rails around the a=
pp's content:</p>
<ul>
<li>A navigation bar at compact, a navigation rail at medium and larger.</l=
i>
<li>At medium, a navigation bar is used instead when a nested
<code>md-gb-pane-scaffold</code> shows two panes, unless the window height =
is compact.</li>
<li>A companion rail sits on the trailing side at large and extra-large.</l=
i>
<li>A toolbar floats in the bottom rail region at compact.</li>
<li>The FAB sits 16 px from the trailing and bottom edges of the content, a=
nd the
snackbar sits above it.</li>
</ul>
