<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"foundations-scaffold--accessibility" tabindex=3D"-1">Accessibilit=
y</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#foundations-scaffold--accessibility"><span cla=
ss=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CAccessibility=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-=
hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>Give each navigation component an <code>aria-label</code>, such as "Pri=
mary navigation", and keep the bar and rail selections in sync.</li>
<li>In a single-pane list-detail layout, provide a back button that calls <=
code>closeDetail()</code>.</li>
<li>A modal levitated pane takes focus, closes with Escape and when someone=
 uses the content behind it, and is named by <code>levitate-label</code>.</=
li>
<li>A floating pane's move and resize handles also work with the arrow keys=
. Use <code>drag-handle-label</code>, <code>levitate-move-label</code> and =
<code>levitate-resize-label</code> to translate their names.</li>
</ul>
