<div class=3D"heading h3">
<h3 id=3D"styles-typography--tokens-1" tabindex=3D"-1">Tokens</h3>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#styles-typography--tokens-1"><span class=3D"of=
fscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CTokens=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=3D"true"=
>#</span></a></div>
<p>The scale has five roles (display, headline, title, body, label), each i=
n
<code>sm</code>, <code>md</code>, and <code>lg</code>, plus emphasized styl=
es per role. Tokens follow
<code>--md-sys-typescale-&lt;role&gt;-&lt;size&gt;-&lt;property&gt;</code> =
with the properties <code>font</code>,
<code>size</code>, <code>line-height</code>, <code>weight</code>, <code>tra=
cking</code>, and <code>axes</code>; the bare
<code>--md-sys-typescale-&lt;role&gt;-&lt;size&gt;</code> is the combined <=
code>font</code> shorthand.</p>
<div class=3D"gb-table" tabindex=3D"0" role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Table =
27"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Typescale</th>
<th>Tokens</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Display</td>
<td><code>--md-sys-typescale-display-md-size</code>, <code>-line-height</co=
de>, <code>-weight</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Headline</td>
<td><code>--md-sys-typescale-headline-md-size</code>, <code>-line-height</c=
ode>, <code>-weight</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Title</td>
<td><code>--md-sys-typescale-title-md-size</code>, <code>-line-height</code=
>, <code>-weight</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Body</td>
<td><code>--md-sys-typescale-body-md-size</code>, <code>-line-height</code>=
, <code>-weight</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Label</td>
<td><code>--md-sys-typescale-label-md-size</code>, <code>-line-height</code=
>, <code>-weight</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Emphasized</td>
<td><code>--md-sys-typescale-emphasized-&lt;role&gt;-&lt;size&gt;</code></t=
d>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<p><strong>Language height.</strong> Line heights adapt to the script. Set
<code>--md-sys-language-height-scale</code> (1, 1.07, 1.3, or 2) on <code>:=
root</code> to change the
default; text in languages such as Arabic, Thai, or Urdu picks up its heigh=
t
from <code>:lang()</code>.</p>
