<div class=3D"heading h3">
<h3 id=3D"styles-motion--spring-tokens" tabindex=3D"-1">Spring tokens</h3>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#styles-motion--spring-tokens"><span class=3D"o=
ffscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CSpring tokens=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=
=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
