=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CSkeleton loaders=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria=
-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<p>For the step from a loading state to loaded content. The skeleton hints =
at
where content will appear and holds its space, so the layout does not shift=
