<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-button-group--accessibility" tabindex=3D"-1">Accessibi=
lity</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-button-group--accessibility"><span =
class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CAccessibility=E2=80=9D</span> <span ar=
ia-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>The group does not need a label of its own, but a name such as <code>ar=
ia-label=3D"Text alignment"</code> helps when the buttons form a set.</li>
<li>Label each button as you would a <a href=3D"#components-button">button<=
/a>; icon-only buttons need <code>aria-label</code>.</li>
<li>Tab enters the group, Arrow keys move between buttons, and Enter or Spa=
ce activates the focused button.</li>
</ul>
