<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-fab-menu--usage-guidelines" tabindex=3D"-1">Usage guid=
elines</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-fab-menu--usage-guidelines"><span c=
lass=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CUsage guidelines=E2=80=9D</span> <span =
aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li><strong>Open it from a FAB.</strong> The menu appears where the FAB was=
, and not from an extended FAB or any other component.</li>
<li><strong>Keep it related.</strong> A menu holds 2 to 6 closely related a=
ctions under one purpose, such as sharing.</li>
<li><strong>Align to the trailing edge.</strong> The FAB and menu sit at th=
e trailing edge of the window, mirrored in right-to-left languages.</li>
<li><strong>Always label items.</strong> Every item needs a text label.</li=
>
</ul>
