<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-fab--accessibility" tabindex=3D"-1">Accessibility</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-fab--accessibility"><span class=3D"=
offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CAccessibility=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=
=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>An icon-only FAB needs an <code>aria-label</code> that describes its ac=
tion, such as "Compose a new message".</li>
<li>An extended FAB uses its <code>label</code> as its name, also while col=
lapsed. Add <code>aria-label</code> only for more context.</li>
<li>An icon-only FAB shows a tooltip on hover and focus. Set <code>tooltip=
=3D"false"</code> to turn it off.</li>
<li>A FAB fixed over scrolling content shouldn't hide focused elements. Reg=
ister it with <code>setupScrollPadding()</code> from <code>appbar/scroll-pa=
dding.js</code>.</li>
<li>Tab focuses the FAB, and Enter or Space activates it.</li>
</ul>
