<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-segmented-button--accessibility" tabindex=3D"-1">Acces=
sibility</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-segmented-button--accessibility"><s=
pan class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CAccessibility=E2=80=9D</span> <spa=
n aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>Give the set an <code>aria-label</code> that says what the choice is ab=
out.</li>
<li>In a single-select set the segments are radios, and in a multi-select s=
et they are checkboxes. Tab enters the set, the arrow keys move between seg=
ments, and Space or Enter selects the focused one.</li>
<li>Icon-only segments need an <code>aria-label</code>.</li>
<li>A disabled segment is skipped by the keyboard.</li>
</ul>
