<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-date-picker--usage-guidelines" tabindex=3D"-1">Usage g=
uidelines</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-date-picker--usage-guidelines"><spa=
n class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CUsage guidelines=E2=80=9D</span> <sp=
an aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li><strong>Match the context.</strong> Use the docked picker, a calendar u=
nder a text field, on medium and expanded windows. Use a <a href=3D"#compon=
ents-date-picker--modal">modal</a> picker on compact ones.</li>
<li><strong>Pick or type.</strong> A modal picker has a calendar mode and a=
