a-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>Name the field with <code>label</code>, such as "Event date", and use <=
code>supporting-text</code> to show the expected format.</li>
<li>Calendar targets stay 48px, so <code>density</code> only affects the te=
xt fields.</li>
<li>Page Up and Page Down move by month, and Shift with them moves by year.=
</li>
<li>The modal picker closes with Escape, and the docked picker confirms wit=
h Enter.</li>
</ul>
