<ul>
<li>Input mode is an alternative to the dial, and every control has a label=
. Localize the labels with attributes such as <code>select-hour-label</code=
>, <code>hour-label</code>, <code>cancel-label</code> and <code>confirm-lab=
el</code>.</li>
<li>A modal picker is a <code>&lt;dialog&gt;</code>: focus moves into it an=
d returns to the opener on close, and Escape cancels.</li>
<li>In the dial, the arrow keys change the selected hour or minute.</li>
</ul>
