<ul>
<li>A progress indicator is a <code>progressbar</code>. Give it an <a href=
=3D"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Accessibility/ARIA/Attribu=
tes/aria-label"><code>aria-label</code></a> that says what is in progress, =
such as "Download progress".</li>
<li>A determinate indicator exposes its value from 0 to 100 to assistive te=
chnology. An indeterminate one has no value.</li>
</ul>
