<h2 id=3D"components-pull-to-refresh--accessibility" tabindex=3D"-1">Access=
ibility</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-pull-to-refresh--accessibility"><sp=
an class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CAccessibility=E2=80=9D</span> <span=
 aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>Pulling needs a drag, so also provide a button or another control that =
calls <code>refresh()</code>, usable with a single pointer or the keyboard.=
</li>
<li>While refreshing, the indicator is a <code>progressbar</code> named by =
<code>indicator-label</code> (the default is "Refreshing"), and the label i=
s announced politely. Write a label that says what is refreshing, such as "=
Refreshing news".</li>
</ul>
