<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-navigation-drawer--usage-guidelines" tabindex=3D"-1">U=
sage guidelines</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-navigation-drawer--usage-guidelines=
"><span class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CUsage guidelines=E2=80=9D</spa=
n> <span aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li><strong>Use it for top-level destinations.</strong> A drawer lists the =
main sections of an app, with the current one selected.</li>
<li><strong>Choose standard or modal.</strong> A standard drawer (above) si=
ts beside the content on large windows; a <a href=3D"#components-navigation=
-drawer--modal-drawer">modal drawer</a> opens over a scrim on small ones.</=
li>
<li><strong>Group with labels.</strong> Use section labels and dividers to =
organize long lists.</li>
<li><strong>Keep labels short.</strong> Long <a href=3D"#components-navigat=
ion-drawer--text-labels-only">labels</a> truncate.</li>
</ul>
<p>This component is new in <a href=3D"https://m3.material.io/blog/building=
-with-m3-expressive">M3 Expressive</a>.</p>
<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-navigation-drawer--anatomy" tabindex=3D"-1">Anatomy</h=
2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-navigation-drawer--anatomy"><span c=
lass=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CAnatomy=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidd=
en=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
