<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-navigation-drawer--accessibility" tabindex=3D"-1">Acce=
ssibility</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-navigation-drawer--accessibility"><=
span class=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CAccessibility=E2=80=9D</span> <sp=
an aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>The drawer renders a <code>&lt;nav&gt;</code> landmark; give it a name =
with <code>aria-label</code>.</li>
<li>The selected item is the current page and is exposed with <code>aria-cu=
rrent</code>.</li>
<li>A modal drawer is a dialog: it traps focus, closes with Escape, and ret=
urns focus to what opened it.</li>
<li>Tab moves through the items; Enter activates a link item.</li>
</ul>
