<div class=3D"heading h3">
<h3 id=3D"components-navigation-rail--links" tabindex=3D"-1">Links</h3>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-navigation-rail--links"><span class=
=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CLinks=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidden=3D"=
true">#</span></a></div>
<p>Give an item an <code>href</code> (and optionally <code>target</code> an=
d <code>rel</code>) to make the destination a link, as in the first example=
. The item then has the <code>link</code> role and the selected one is mark=
ed <code>aria-current=3D"page"</code>. Without <code>href</code> an item is=
 a tab that just reports the selection.</p>
