<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-sheets--accessibility" tabindex=3D"-1">Accessibility</=
h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-sheets--accessibility"><span class=
=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CAccessibility=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hi=
dden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>A modal sheet is a <code>&lt;dialog&gt;</code>: focus moves into it, st=
ays inside, and returns to the opener on close. Escape and a click on the s=
crim close it.</li>
<li>Name a bottom sheet with <code>label</code>. A side sheet is named by i=
ts <code>headline</code>, or by <code>label</code> when it has none.</li>
<li>The drag handle is a button, so keyboard users can expand and collapse =
the sheet. Localize <code>drag-handle-label</code>, <code>close-label</code=
> and <code>back-label</code>.</li>
</ul>
