<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-card--usage-guidelines" tabindex=3D"-1">Usage guidelin=
es</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-card--usage-guidelines"><span class=
=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CUsage guidelines=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria=
-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li><strong>One subject per card.</strong> A card shows related content and=
 actions about a single topic, arranged so the hierarchy is clear.</li>
<li><strong>Choose a color.</strong> Use <a href=3D"#components-card--color=
s">elevated, filled or outlined</a> to set how much the card stands out fro=
m its background.</li>
<li><strong>Make it an entry point.</strong> An <a href=3D"#components-card=
--interactive">interactive card</a> can lead to more detail or another page=
.</li>
<li><strong>Lay out collections.</strong> Cards work in a grid, a vertical =
list or a carousel.</li>
</ul>
<p>This component is new in <a href=3D"https://m3.material.io/blog/building=
-with-m3-expressive">M3 Expressive</a>.</p>
