<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-carousel--usage-guidelines" tabindex=3D"-1">Usage guid=
elines</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-carousel--usage-guidelines"><span c=
lass=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CUsage guidelines=E2=80=9D</span> <span =
aria-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li><strong>Lead with visuals.</strong> Items emphasize an image and can ca=
rry a brief label that adapts to the item size.</li>
<li><strong>Choose a layout.</strong> Use <code>multi-browse</code> for var=
ied sizes, <code>hero</code> to feature an item, <code>uncontained</code> f=
or items that run edge to edge, and <code>full-screen</code> for one item a=
t a time.</li>
<li><strong>Match scrolling to the layout.</strong> Snap scrolling suits mu=
lti-browse, hero and full-screen. Free scrolling suits uncontained.</li>
</ul>
<p>This component is new in <a href=3D"https://m3.material.io/blog/building=
-with-m3-expressive">M3 Expressive</a>.</p>
