<li>The carousel is a region with the role description "carousel". Name it =
with <code>aria-label</code>.</li>
<li>Each item's <code>label</code> is its accessible name, read with its po=
sition in the set.</li>
<li>Tab or the arrow keys move between items, and Enter or Space activates =
the focused one.</li>
<li>Give images a text alternative, or hide decorative ones.</li>
