<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-dialog--usage-guidelines" tabindex=3D"-1">Usage guidel=
ines</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-dialog--usage-guidelines"><span cla=
ss=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CUsage guidelines=E2=80=9D</span> <span ar=
ia-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li><strong>Use them sparingly.</strong> A dialog interrupts people to ask =
for a decision or to show critical information, so it blocks the rest of th=
e app until it is dismissed.</li>
<li><strong>Pick the right priority.</strong> For low or medium priority in=
formation, use a snackbar instead.</li>
<li><strong>Choose basic or full-screen.</strong> Use a basic dialog by def=
ault. A <a href=3D"#components-dialog--full-screen">full-screen dialog</a> =
suits compact windows with a lot of content.</li>
<li><strong>Order the actions.</strong> Put the dismissive action first and=
 the confirming action last.</li>
</ul>
