<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-dialog--accessibility" tabindex=3D"-1">Accessibility</=
h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-dialog--accessibility"><span class=
=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CAccessibility=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hi=
dden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>The headline names the dialog. Add <code>aria-label</code> to a dialog =
without a headline.</li>
<li>A basic dialog is an alert dialog (<code>role=3D"alertdialog"</code>) b=
y default, as M3 asks for on the web. Set <code>type=3D"dialog"</code> for =
a plain dialog.</li>
<li>Focus moves into the dialog and Tab cycles inside it. Escape closes it =
and focus returns to what opened it.</li>
<li>Label buttons and fields inside the dialog as you would elsewhere. In a=
 full-screen dialog, set <code>close-label</code> to name the close button.=
</li>
</ul>
