<tr>
<th>Slot</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>default</td>
<td>The supporting text or custom content (lists, form fields). Scrolls bet=
ween the pinned headline and actions when it overflows.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>actions</code></td>
<td>The action buttons, dismissive first and confirming last. Basic: end-al=
igned below the content. Full-screen: the confirm action at the end of the =
header.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>headline</code></td>
<td>The headline. Labels the dialog (<code>aria-labelledby</code>).</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>icon</code></td>
<td>An optional hero icon above the headline (basic only). Centers the head=
line.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<div class=3D"heading h4">
<h4 id=3D"components-dialog--events" tabindex=3D"-1">Events</h4>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-dialog--events"><span class=3D"offs=
