</span></a></div>
<div class=3D"gb-table" tabindex=3D"0" role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Table =
169"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Event</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>cancel</code><br><span class=3D"gb-desc">Event</span></td>
<td>Fired when the dialog is canceled with Escape, a scrim click or the ful=
l-screen close button. Cancelable; canceling keeps the dialog open.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>close</code><br><span class=3D"gb-desc">Event</span></td>
<td>Fired when the dialog begins closing; <code>returnValue</code> is alrea=
dy set. Cancelable.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>closed</code><br><span class=3D"gb-desc">Event</span></td>
<td>Fired when the dialog has closed and animations finished.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>open</code><br><span class=3D"gb-desc">Event</span></td>
<td>Fired when the dialog begins opening. Cancelable.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>opened</code><br><span class=3D"gb-desc">Event</span></td>
<td>Fired when the dialog has opened and animations finished.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
