170"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Method</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>close</code><br><span class=3D"gb-desc">(returnValue?: string, re=
ason?: string) =3D&gt; Promise&lt;void&gt;</span></td>
<td>Closes the dialog and fires a cancelable <code>close</code> event, then=
 <code>closed</code> after the exit animation. Focus returns to the element=
 focused before the dialog opened.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>show</code><br><span class=3D"gb-desc">() =3D&gt; Promise&lt;void=
&gt;</span></td>
<td>Opens the dialog as a modal and fires a cancelable <code>open</code> ev=
ent, then <code>opened</code> after the enter animation. Focus moves to the=
 first child with an <code>autofocus</code> attribute, else the first focus=
able element, else the dialog.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
