<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-list--accessibility" tabindex=3D"-1">Accessibility</h2=
>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-list--accessibility"><span class=3D=
"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CAccessibility=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidde=
n=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>A list has <code>role=3D"list"</code>, and <code>role=3D"listbox"</code=
> when it is <code>selectable</code>. Items have <code>role=3D"listitem"</c=
ode>. Label a list with <code>aria-label</code> or <code>aria-labelledby</c=
ode> when its purpose isn't clear from the page.</li>
<li>Arrow keys move between items.</li>
<li>In a reorderable list, the drag handle and the move up and move down bu=
ttons have labels built from the item's text, and moves are announced to sc=
reen readers. Change them with <code>drag-handle-label</code>, <code>move-u=
p-label</code> and <code>move-down-label</code> when you translate the page=
.</li>
<li>Give swipe action buttons an <code>aria-label</code> that names the ite=
m, such as "Share Fresh baked breads".</li>
<li>Selecting and reordering must not need a gesture only: the checkboxes, =
the move buttons and the "more" button are the single-pointer alternatives.=
</li>
</ul>
