<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-menu--accessibility" tabindex=3D"-1">Accessibility</h2=
>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-menu--accessibility"><span class=3D=
"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CAccessibility=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hidde=
n=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>The menu has <code>role=3D"menu"</code>, and items have <code>role=3D"m=
enuitem"</code>, or <code>menuitemradio</code> and <code>menuitemcheckbox</=
code> in checkable groups.</li>
<li>On the button that opens the menu, Up and Down open it and focus the fi=
rst item; Enter and Space open it natively.</li>
<li>In an open menu, Up and Down move between items (disabled items include=
d), Home and End go to the first and last item, and typing a letter jumps t=
o the next item that starts with it.</li>
<li>Escape and Tab close the menu and return focus to the button. Left (Rig=
ht in right-to-left layouts) closes a submenu.</li>
<li>Give a menu that has no clear visible title an <code>aria-label</code>.=
</li>
</ul>
