<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-search--usage-guidelines" tabindex=3D"-1">Usage guidel=
ines</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-search--usage-guidelines"><span cla=
ss=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CUsage guidelines=E2=80=9D</span> <span ar=
ia-hidden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li><strong>Use it to navigate with queries.</strong> Search is the entry p=
oint for finding content in a product by typing.</li>
<li><strong>Hint what to search.</strong> A bar can show hinted text such a=
s "Search recipes", a leading icon and up to two <a href=3D"#components-sea=
rch--trailing-elements">trailing</a> icons.</li>
<li><strong>Suggest as people type.</strong> The view lists suggestions or =
results below the bar as the query changes.</li>
<li><strong>Choose a style.</strong> The contained style is recommended; th=
e <a href=3D"#components-search--divided">divided</a> style puts a divider =
between the header and the results.</li>
<li><strong>Make it prominent.</strong> A <a href=3D"#components-search--se=
arch-app-bar">search app bar</a> gives search an emphasized, global entry p=
oint.</li>
</ul>
<p>This component is new in <a href=3D"https://m3.material.io/blog/building=
-with-m3-expressive">M3 Expressive</a>.</p>
