<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-search--accessibility" tabindex=3D"-1">Accessibility</=
h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-search--accessibility"><span class=
=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CAccessibility=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-hi=
dden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>The bar's input and the view's input are comboboxes, and the suggestion=
s are the options of a <code>listbox</code>. Slotted results without a role=
 get <code>role=3D"option"</code>.</li>
<li>Enter, the Down arrow or typing opens the view. The back button and Esc=
ape close it.</li>
<li>The input is named by <code>label</code>, which defaults to <code>place=
holder</code>. Set <code>label</code> when the hint isn't a good name.</li>
<li>Give icon buttons in the slots an <code>aria-label</code>, such as "Voi=
ce search".</li>
<li>Change <code>back-label</code>, <code>clear-label</code>, <code>results=
-label</code> and <code>searching-label</code> when you translate the page.=
 Announce changing results with <code>suggestions-label</code>.</li>
</ul>
