nd value. Set <code>value-label</code> (or <code>value-label-start</code> a=
nd <code>value-label-end</code>) when the number alone is unclear: the text=
 is shown on the label and read out, such as "5 minutes".</li>
<li>Arrow keys change the value by one step, Page Up and Page Down by a lar=
ger amount, and Home and End jump to the ends.</li>
