<div class=3D"heading h2">
<h2 id=3D"components-snackbar--accessibility" tabindex=3D"-1">Accessibility=
</h2>
<a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"#components-snackbar--accessibility"><span clas=
s=3D"offscreen">Link to =E2=80=9CAccessibility=E2=80=9D</span> <span aria-h=
idden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>The message is announced politely in a live region, so focus stays wher=
e it is.</li>
<li>Auto-dismissing snackbars are hard to read for people with low vision o=
r who need more time. Give the same information inline, or add an action so=
 the snackbar stays until it is used.</li>
<li>Give a snackbar that has a close button a localized <code>close-label</=
code>.</li>
<li>Escape closes the snackbar, and a slotted action is a normal button in =
the tab order.</li>
</ul>
