</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>actionLabel</code><br><span class=3D"gb-desc">Visible text of the=
 built-in action button. Rendered only when non-empty and nothing is slotte=
d into <code>action</code>.</span></td>
<td><code>action-label</code></td>
<td><code>string</code></td>
<td><code>''</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>align</code><br><span class=3D"gb-desc">Where a snackbar sits on =
wide layouts: <code>center</code> (default) or <code>start</code> (left-ali=
gned). Use the same value wherever snackbars appear, so they always show in=
 the same spot. Compact layouts span the width.</span></td>
<td><code>align</code></td>
<td><code>"start"</code></td>
<td>"center"</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>anchor</code><br><span class=3D"gb-desc">The id of an element the=
 snackbar appears above, such as a FAB or a docked toolbar, in the snackbar=
's root (document or shadow root). See <code>anchorElement</code>.</span></=
td>
<td><code>anchor</code></td>
<td><code>string</code></td>
<td><code>''</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>anchorElement</code><br><span class=3D"gb-desc">An element the sn=
ackbar appears above, such as a FAB or a docked toolbar: while open, the sn=
ackbar's bottom edge sits <code>--bottom-offset</code> above the element's =
top edge. Takes precedence over <code>anchor</code>.</span></td>
<td></td>
<td><code>HTMLElement</code></td>
<td><code>null</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>closeLabel</code><br><span class=3D"gb-desc">Accessible label for=
