<td><code>boolean</code></td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>quick</code><br><span class=3D"gb-desc">Whether to skip opening a=
nd closing transition delays.</span></td>
<td><code>quick</code></td>
<td><code>boolean</code></td>
<td><code>false</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>timeoutMs</code><br><span class=3D"gb-desc">Time in milliseconds =
before the snackbar automatically dismisses. Set to 0 or a negative value (=
e.g. -1) to disable auto-dismiss. Read when the snackbar opens; changing it=
 while open takes effect on the next open.</span></td>
