dden=3D"true">#</span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>A plain tooltip is a <code>tooltip</code> that describes its anchor, an=
d it opens on hover and on keyboard focus. Keep the anchor's own accessible=
 name, such as an <code>aria-label</code> on an icon button.</li>
<li>A rich tooltip with actions is a <code>dialog</code>, so its buttons ca=
n be reached with the keyboard.</li>
<li>Escape closes an open tooltip.</li>
<li>Don't put information in a tooltip that people can't find another way, =
since touch users can't hover.</li>
</ul>
